sequenceDiagram
    participant POS as Integration checkout
    participant SDK as Java SDK
    participant API as Cheqi API
    participant Worker as Integration recovery worker
    POS->>SDK: issueReceipt(identification, payload, storeId)
    SDK->>API: Resolve owner devices (one attempt)
    API-->>SDK: matchId and temporary device keys
    SDK->>API: Submit independently encrypted device payloads (one attempt)
    alt Accepted
        API-->>SDK: Original submission acknowledgement
        SDK-->>POS: DIGITAL_SUBMITTED
    else Timeout, outage, malformed acknowledgement, or IN_PROGRESS
        SDK-->>POS: DIGITAL_PENDING, matchId, prepared encrypted download and URL
        POS->>POS: Persist recovery data and show QR
        POS->>Worker: Schedule background recovery
        Worker->>SDK: uploadPreparedDownload(original prepared download)
        SDK->>API: Upload original ciphertext and download id
        Note over SDK,API: URL fragment AES key never reaches API
        Worker->>SDK: resumeReceipt(matchId, payload, storeId)
        SDK->>API: GET match status (no matching identifiers)
        alt SUBMITTED
            API-->>SDK: Original submission
        else MATCHED
            API-->>SDK: Original device key snapshot
            SDK->>API: Regenerated ciphertext for same matchId
        else IN_PROGRESS
            API-->>SDK: Retry delay
        else EXPIRED
            API-->>SDK: Expired; digital submission cannot be revived
        end
        SDK-->>Worker: DIGITAL_SUBMITTED, DIGITAL_PENDING, or DIGITAL_EXPIRED
    end
